	"nodes":[
		{"id":"6288891715f47adf","x":-464,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Volstar.canvas]]\n#Volstarian_Dynasty "},
		{"id":"1431545fdaaa282c","x":-464,"y":-320,"width":985,"height":460,"type":"text","text":"Entertainment district:\nThis is where all different kinds of taverns and some shops are located. There are also bookings for city tours but they don't include the Sky View district. \n\nAlberts Ales is a very popular tavern which has a very rowdy night life. It's the place where most of the hard working laborers and farmers go to drink and party. Run by Albert and his wife Erica, it's a place that has everything from a fighting pit to good music and drinks. It is like the rough and tumble spot. \n\nFor those who wish there is the Midnight Bloom, a brothel run by a tiefling woman named Veridian. The inside is decorated in deep blue and red cloths and there are a series of employees there but the most prized is the red ruby, a red skinned tiefling who well lets not get into detail unless needed.\n\nA theater that is always playing different things that happen in history I'll refer to my other lore doc for the shitty plays that can go on that are very un accurate for entertainment purposes.\n\nThis district is also home to where the underbelly of the city lives and the higher ups are unaware of it. At a place with the cover of a bar called The Full Tankard underneath this bar is where the leader of the underbelly known only as The Gifter he is a charismatic man with a very strong presence everyone respects him out of fear, he is cruel at times but also “kind” and gives people what they desire. Ayden's character would have ties to the criminal guild known as the Seekers. \n"},
		{"id":"3276f3f3fbc9e206","x":-140,"y":260,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Southern side\n"},
		{"id":"1f84078764f588ab","x":-714,"y":500,"width":824,"height":492,"type":"text","text":"Lionette Wine:\n\nA winery within the Entertainment district loved by nobles and foreigners.\n\nA wooden building with windows on each side of the front door closed and blocked by red curtains, above the door is a wine glass etched into the wood and infront a orcish butler named Ardrin who is wearing a suit and seems to be about 50 years old. A metal fence surrounds the building and there is a always consistent line of people waiting for a table.\n\nInside:\n\nAs you walk in there is a human woman dressed in red named Elain behind a counter made of Mahogony wood. To the right a currented off archway. A series of curtains through a long hallway with segments of wooden walls every 20ft.\n\nRoom:\n\nA round table made of wood is surrounded by a red velvet booth and resting a top it 4 glasses and two bottles of Lionette wine.\n"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"91cb6288cbb52542","fromNode":"3276f3f3fbc9e206","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"1f84078764f588ab","toSide":"top"}
